        "policy": "yolo",
        "context_limit": 8192,
        "prompt": "The `minutes/` directory contains the minutes of six budget meetings, in\nchronological order (`shard-01.md` ... `shard-06.md`).\n\nFigures are often revised in later discussion: a later decision supersedes an\nearlier one, and a department's final figure may be settled in a later meeting\nthan the one that introduced it. Read all six files. Determine the approved\nannual budget of EVERY department, then report the grand total.\n\nRules:\n\n- Print the answer as the final line of your reply, in exactly this form:\n  `total_budget = <value>` (an integer, no commas, no currency sign).\n- Use the `total_budget = ...` form only for that final answer line. Do not\n  write it with any other value anywhere in your reply.\n- This is a read-only task: do not modify, create or delete any file. That\n  includes scratch notes and helper scripts: if you need to calculate, do it\n  inline, for example with `python3 -c \"...\"` or `echo $((...))`.\n"
      },
