        "policy": "read-only",
        "context_limit": null,
        "prompt": "The current working directory contains a small app: `app.py`,\n`config/default.ini`, `config/override.ini`, `README.md` and\n`config/README.md`.\n\nWhich `release_channel` does the app actually use when it starts?\n\nRules:\n\n- Print the answer as the final line of your reply, in exactly this form:\n  `release_channel = <value>`\n- Use the `release_channel = ...` form only for that final answer line. Do not\n  write it with any other value anywhere in your reply.\n- Read-only task: do not modify, create or delete any file.\n"
      }
    ]
